# Russian toward-hour clock: the half NAMES the coming hour with a genitive
# ordinal -- "половина девятого" (also contracted "полдевятого") == half OF
# the ninth == 08:30.  Handled by the bare_half_to + toward_hour_12h
# conventions.  Citation: gramota.ru (Russian State Language reference
# service), telling the time -- "половина <genitive ordinal>" counts toward
# the coming hour.
половина
